# Product SOP teaching example

This English example follows section 7 of the Product Documentation SOP design baseline 0.2. All inputs, tasks, and decisions below are fictional and illustrate the structure. For real work, use the current workflow and effective project decisions. Keep the example's confirmation and test states as shown. [Chinese export](产品教学示例.md) and [provenance](产品教学示例.provenance.json)

## 7. Full example structure for a local to-do list

