| Field | Fictional entry |
| --- | --- |
| Project, version, and state | DEMO-TODO / DEMO-v0.1 / draft, unconfirmed |
| User and scenario U01 | An individual organizes tasks before starting work each day. This scenario is assumed. Actual users have yet to be observed. |
| Problem P01 | Temporary tasks are written on paper. On returning to work, completed tasks are difficult to distinguish. Evidence for the existing method and problem is missing. |
| Goal G01 | Proposed outcome is adding a task, marking it complete, and recognizing the result after reopening. A numerical efficiency claim would need evidence. |
