| Sources and confirmation | DEMO-S01 is the fictional scenario. DEMO-S02 is the fictional design suggestion. Initialization confirmation is unprovided. |

DEMO-Q01 asks whether a task added successfully before closing should remain on the next launch. Offer “Keep until the next launch” as the proposal, “Use for this session only,” and an open answer. Keep the data behavior and dependent tasks pending until an actual decision.

