A real project can use this structure for a single aggregate SOP with phase history, Product and Technical objects, current outcomes by confirmed criterion and platform, findings, and evidence attachments. This fictional material contains eight candidate pairs. Deliverables, installers, observed PC/PM scores, a score of 95, and a human-test ratio of at most 10% all require actual project evidence.
